                        caption: '“THE FIRST SERIES. Hieroglyphics to express Words relative to Animal Actions and Affections.”: the first page of the series, English p. 19, with twenty-five of its signs, each with Hammer’s English word printed beneath it. The series runs on to p. 22.',
